No data files are stored in this repository. The scripts in scripts/ fetch the public data sets below, which keep
their own terms.

Data
- Kansas Geological Survey (KGS) LAS archive and formation tops: "The source of this material is the Kansas
  Geological Survey website at https://www.kgs.ku.edu/. All Rights Reserved."
  Terms: https://www.kgs.ku.edu/General/copyright.html
- FORCE 2020 Machine Learning Contest (Bormann et al., 2020),
  https://github.com/bolgebrygg/Force-2020-Machine-Learning-competition. Well logs: NLOD 2.0; labels: CC BY 4.0.
  "Lithofacies data was provided by the FORCE Machine Learning competition with well logs and seismic 2020."
- Wister geothermal prospect wells 12-27 and 85-20 (Ormat), DOE Geothermal Data Repository submission 904,
  https://gdr.openei.org/submissions/904, CC BY 4.0.

Dependencies keep their own licences; see Cargo.lock and pyproject.toml.
